#: ../../docs/cost/ids/sustainability.md:36
msgid ""
"Disclose the procurement strategy risk assessment. This tends to be part of "
"the decision-making strategy and likely includes discussions regarding "
"capabilities, the delivery model and the rationale for the risk allocation "
"decision."
